v1" begin="00:18.610" end="00:21.850"><span begin="00:18.610" end="00:19.060">I've </span><span begin="00:19.060" end="00:19.390">been </span><span begin="00:19.390" end="00:20.170">good</span><span begin="00:20.170" end="00:20.200">, </span><span begin="00:20.200" end="00:20.590">don't </span><span begin="00:20.590" end="00:20.770">I </span><span begin="00:20.770" end="00:21.520">deserve </span><span begin="00:21.520" end="00:21.820">it</span><span begin="00:21.820" end="00:21.850">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.850" end="00:25.210"><span begin="00:21.850" end="00:22.060">I </span><span begin="00:22.060" end="00:22.480">think </span><span begin="00:22.480" end="00:22.720">I </span><span begin="00:22.720" end="00:23.170">earned </span><span begin="00:23.170" end="00:23.380">it</span><span begin="00:23.380" end="00:23.380">, </span><span begin="00:23.380" end="00:23.860">feels </span><span begin="00:23.860" end="00:24.160">like </span><span begin="00:24.160" end="00:24.370">it's </span><span begin="00:24.370" end="00:24.850">worth </span><span begin="00:24.850" end="00:25.210">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.210" end="00:32.140"><span begin="00:25.210" end="00:25.480">In </span><span begin="00:25.480" end="00:25.810">my </span><span begin="00:25.810" end="00:27.910">mind</span><span begin="00:27.910" end="00:27.910">, </span><span begin="00:27.910" end="00:32.140">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.470" end="00:38.620"><span begin="00:32.470" end="00:33.670">Twisted </span><span begin="00:33.670" end="00:35.500">reality</span><span begin="00:35.500" end="00:35.680">, </span><span begin="00:35.680" end="00:36.850">hopeless </span><span begin="00:36.850" end="00:38.620">insanity</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.770" end="00:43.810"><span begin="00:38.770" end="00:38.950">I </span><span begin="00:38.950" end="00:39.610">told </span><span begin="00:39.610" end="00:39.850">you </span><span begin="00:39.850" end="00:40.030">I </sp