 </span><span begin="01:57.370" end="01:58.000">told </span><span begin="01:58.000" end="01:58.240">you </span><span begin="01:58.240" end="01:58.420">I </span><span begin="01:58.420" end="01:58.720">was </span><span begin="01:58.720" end="01:59.560">okay </span><span begin="01:59.560" end="01:59.860">but </span><span begin="01:59.860" end="02:00.040">I </span><span begin="02:00.040" end="02:00.340">was </span><span begin="02:00.340" end="02:02.380">lying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.920" end="02:07.090"><span begin="02:02.920" end="02:03.280">I </span><span begin="02:03.280" end="02:03.850">was </span><span begin="02:03.850" end="02:04.750">dancing </span><span begin="02:04.750" end="02:04.960">with </span><span begin="02:04.960" end="02:05.140">the </span><span begin="02:05.140" end="02:07.090">devil</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.090" end="02:10.090"><span begin="02:07.090" end="02:07.780">Out </span><span begin="02:07.780" end="02:07.900">of </span><span begin="02:07.900" end="02:10.090">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.150" end="02:12.580"><span begin="02:10.150" end="02:10.690">Almost </span><span begin="02:10.690" end="02:11.110">made </span><span begin="02:11.110" end="02:11.230">it </span><span begin="02:11.230" end="02:11.440">to </span><span begin="02:11.440" end="02:12.580">heaven</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.580" end="02:16.780"><span begin="02:12.580" end="02:12.820">It </span><span begin="02:12.820" end="02:13.420">was </span><span begin="02:13.420" end="02:14.260">closer </span><span begin="02:14.260" end="02:14.500">than </span><span begin="02:14.500" end="02:14.830">you </span><span begin="02:14.830" end="02:16.780">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.780" end="02:19.810"><span begin="02:16.780" end="02:17.530">Playing </span><span begin="02:17.530" end="02:17.740">with </span><span begin="02:17.740" end="02:17.980">the </span><span begin="02:17.980" end="02:19.810">enemy</span></p><p ttm: